## Text Streaming

```javascript
client.addEventListener('message', e => {
  const { data, stream } = e.detail;
  if (stream) console.log('Chunk:', data);
  else console.log('Final:', data);
});
```

**Notes:**
- Only for text generation
- Automatically handles `[DONE]` signals and cleans up

## Config Image Client

```javascript
client.setTimeout(30000);
client.setRetry(true, 2, 1000);
client.setSeed(12345);
```

**Notes:**
- Timeout limits request duration
- Retry auto-retries failed calls
- Seed ensures consistent output
